                "On the LS-HIL stand, lanthanum-fluoride precipitator LF-3 rattles at 64 pps against a 16 pps "
                "hush floor while rectifier current is still 28 kW under a 44 kW trip. Parking the "
                "9 t/h rake raise is the only legal move; a kW-first close would slam power into a singing "
                "cathode. The puck outranks the rake gearbox.",